      "text": "ENTITIES\nregion(region_id PK, name,\n  cp_status HEALTHY|DEGRADED|DOWN, dp_status,\n  as_of, version)\nload_balancer(lb_id PK, account_id, name,\n  home_region, epoch, config_version, dns_name,\n  state ACTIVE|FAILING_OVER|FENCED|DELETED)\n  -- directory row: global, quorum-replicated\nha_config(lb_id PK, backup_regions (ordered),\n  mode MANUAL|AUTO, standby WARM|COLD, version)\nlb_config(lb_id, config_version, listeners, rules)\n  -- owned by home region, replicated async\ntarget_group(tg_id PK, lb_id, region, protocol, port)\ntarget(tg_id, target_id, ip|host, port)\n  -- rows, not arrays inside region\nfailover_op(op_id PK, idempotency_key UNIQUE, lb_id,\n  from_region, to_region, epoch, status)\n\nAPIs (account from signed request, never the body)\nPOST /v1/load-balancers   Idempotency-Key\n  {region, name, listeners, ha_config}\n  -> 202 {lb_id, dns_name, home_region, op_id}\nGET /v1/load-balancers/{id}   (any region serves it)\n  -> config, home_region, epoch, config_version, as_of\nPUT /v1/load-balancers/{id}/ha-config   If-Match\n  -> 200 | 412 stale version\nPOST /v1/load-balancers/{id}/target-groups\n  {region, targets:[...]} -> 201\nPOST /v1/load-balancers/{id}/failover  Idempotency-Key\n  {to_region} -> 202 {op_id, epoch}\n  | 409 already failed over | 422 no backup capacity\nGET /v1/regions -> [{region, cp_status, as_of}]\nGET /v1/operations/{op_id}\nWrite to an LB whose home is down -> 503\n  HOME_REGION_UNAVAILABLE (+ failover hint)",
      "originalText": "ENTITIES\nregion(region_id PK, name,\n  cp_status HEALTHY|DEGRADED|DOWN, dp_status,\n  as_of, version)\nload_balancer(lb_id PK, account_id, name,\n  home_region, epoch, config_version, dns_name,\n  state ACTIVE|FAILING_OVER|FENCED|DELETED)\n  -- directory row: global, quorum-replicated\nha_config(lb_id PK, backup_regions (ordered),\n  mode MANUAL|AUTO, standby WARM|COLD, version)\nlb_config(lb_id, config_version, listeners, rules)\n  -- owned by home region, replicated async\ntarget_group(tg_id PK, lb_id, region, protocol, port)\ntarget(tg_id, target_id, ip|host, port)\n  -- rows, not arrays inside region\nfailover_op(op_id PK, idempotency_key UNIQUE, lb_id,\n  from_region, to_region, epoch, status)\n\nAPIs (account from signed request, never the body)\nPOST /v1/load-balancers   Idempotency-Key\n  {region, name, listeners, ha_config}\n  -> 202 {lb_id, dns_name, home_region, op_id}\nGET /v1/load-balancers/{id}   (any region serves it)\n  -> config, home_region, epoch, config_version, as_of\nPUT /v1/load-balancers/{id}/ha-config   If-Match\n  -> 200 | 412 stale version\nPOST /v1/load-balancers/{id}/target-groups\n  {region, targets:[...]} -> 201\nPOST /v1/load-balancers/{id}/failover  Idempotency-Key\n  {to_region} -> 202 {op_id, epoch}\n  | 409 already failed over | 422 no backup capacity\nGET /v1/regions -> [{region, cp_status, as_of}]\nGET /v1/operations/{op_id}\nWrite to an LB whose home is down -> 503\n  HOME_REGION_UNAVAILABLE (+ failover hint)",
